flowchart LR
    subgraph ClientLayer ["Client Layer (Browser / Vanilla ES Modules)"]
        direction TB
        UI["DOM / UI Views (Vanilla JS + CSS)"]
        Store["Client Store (In-Memory pub/sub)"]
        SocketC["Socket.IO Client (Vendored 4.7.5)"]
        RestC["REST API Client (fetch wrapper)"]
        UI <--> Store
        Store <--> SocketC
        Store <--> RestC
    end

    subgraph ServerProcess ["Relay Server Process (Single Python Process)"]
        direction TB
        subgraph TransportLayer ["Transport & API Layer"]
            HTTP["Flask Blueprints (/api/*, static, index)"]
            WS["Flask-SocketIO Handlers (@acked events)"]
        end

        subgraph ServiceLayer ["Service Layer (Pure Domain Logic)"]
            AuthSvc["Auth & Accounts"]
            PresSvc["Presence Registry (In-Memory sid <-> user)"]
            MsgSvc["Messages & Validation"]
            RoomSvc["Rooms & Membership"]
            RcptSvc["Receipts Watermarks"]
            SyncSvc["Catch-up Sync"]
            FileSvc["File Manager"]
            ModSvc["Moderation & Reports"]
            AuditSvc["Append-Only Audit Log"]
            ActSvc["Server Activity"]
            NotifSvc["Notify Engine (socketio.emit boundary)"]
        end

        subgraph PersistenceLayer ["Data & Storage Layer"]
            DB[("SQLite Database\ninstance/relay.db")]
            FileStore[["Local File Store\ninstance/uploads/"]]
        end
    end

    RestC -- "HTTP Request/Response (JSON)" --> HTTP
    SocketC <== "WebSocket Protocol (Socket.IO Events & Acks)" ==> WS

    HTTP --> ServiceLayer
    WS --> ServiceLayer
    ServiceLayer --> PersistenceLayer
    ServiceLayer --> PresSvc
    ServiceLayer --> NotifSvc
    NotifSvc -.->|Push to Socket Rooms| WS
